        <div class="slider-container__row swiper-slide">
          <div class="slide-blockquote">
            <p class="blockquote-quote">“If we want to know what production looks like, we should be able to look at our repository and know - from an infrastructure stack, from a library stack, from an application stack - exactly what is being deployed in production at any given time.”</p>
            <p class="blockquote-author">Bryson Koehler</p>
            <p class="blockquote-author-position">EVP &amp; CTO of Equifax</p>
            
            
            
            <a class="btn btn-secondary btn-link ps-0" href="https://www.sonatype.com/customer-stories/equifax-success-in-security-transformation">See Case Study</a>
            
          </div>
          
          <div class="slide-details">
            
            
            
            
            
            
            
            
            <img src="https://www.sonatype.com/hs-fs/hubfs/1-2023%20New%20Site%20Assets/AWS/logo-equifax.png?width=280&amp;height=55&amp;name=logo-equifax.png" alt="logo-equifax" loading="lazy" width="280" height="55" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;" srcset="https://www.sonatype.com/hs-fs/hubfs/1-2023%20New%20Site%20Assets/AWS/logo-equifax.png?width=140&amp;height=28&amp;name=logo-equifax.png 140w, https://www.sonatype.com/hs-fs/hubfs/1-2023%20New%20Site%20Assets/AWS/logo-equifax.png?width=280&amp;height=55&amp;name=logo-equifax.png 280w, https://www.sonatype.com/hs-fs/hubfs/1-2023%20New%20Site%20Assets/AWS/logo-equifax.png?width=420&amp;height=83&amp;name=logo-equifax.png 420w, https://www.sonatype.com/hs-fs/hubfs/1-2023%20New%20Site%20Assets/AWS/logo-equifax.png?width=560&amp;height=110&amp;name=logo-equifax.png 560w, https://www.sonatype.com/hs-fs/hubfs/1-2023%20New%20Site%20Assets/AWS/logo-equifax.png?width=700&amp;height=138&amp;name=logo-equifax.png 700w, https://www.sonatype.com/hs-fs/hubfs/1-2023%20New%20Site%20Assets/AWS/logo-equifax.png?width=840&amp;height=165&amp;name=logo-equifax.png 840w" sizes="(max-width: 280px) 100vw, 280px">
            

          </div>
          
        </div>
        
        <div class="slider-container__row swiper-slide">
          <div class="slide-blockquote">
            <p class="blockquote-quote">“Sonatype Nexus Repository Manager provides a central platform for storing build artifacts, saving us significant maintenance and hardware costs. I am very confident of its reliability.”</p>
            <p class="blockquote-author">Hagen Rahn</p>
            <p class="blockquote-author-position">Senior Software Engineer, Systema</p>
            
          </div>
          
