          </div>
          
        </div>
        
        <div class="slider-container__row swiper-slide">
          <div class="slide-blockquote">
            <p class="blockquote-quote">“We implemented the new framework to provide substantial shift left capabilities, quality assessment processes, and a real focus on ensuring our open source library consumption was safe.”</p>
            <p class="blockquote-author">Ken D’Auria</p>
            <p class="blockquote-author-position">Director of Engineering, The Hartford</p>
            
